osal, Discontinue Service, Approval Required, new hotel, new property.\n\n6) \"Front-End Engineering\" : crowd-strike\n\nOutput format EXACTLY:\n{\n  \"team\": \"<Team>\", // full team name e.g : Content Support\n  \"tag\": \"<short-tag>\",\n  \"fallback\": <true/false>\n}",
